                                "sense_id": "0e6abffe-db22-397e-ad28-023f2b76e5bf",
                                "text": "Lovers of style and beauty the world over have for decades, even centuries now, looked back to the days of the last lavish escapades of the French courts whenever there is a resurge of the human appetite for the ornate, gilded opulence that you see characterized in these pieces."
